assert max_sum_nonadjacent([3, 2, 5, 10, 7]) == 15
assert max_sum_nonadjacent([5, 5, 10, 100, 10, 5]) == 110

## Canonical Elixir names (use verbatim)
- Module: `Solution`
- Function: `max_sum_nonadjacent`

